<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Swift Energy started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Swift Energy started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Swift Energy Co with a buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- said the company has a track record of strong production and reserve growth, which should continue in the future.</p>
<p>-- Salomon estimated Swift will see 49 percent annual production growth and 37 percent annual reserve growth through the year 2000.</p>
<p>-- Swift's stock was down 1-1/8 to 28-3/4 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
